  "description": "Jobs a restart picks up with 8, 9 or 10 of their 10 continuations spent: at the cap each waits for the owner, interrupted with Try again, its branch kept and its reason naming the cap and what cut it last; one with a try left takes it; the owner's signed Try again starts the count again.",
